# Standard Worker Device Sign In Auth (ASIS)

``` mermaid
flowchart LR

    User[Standard User]

    HS[High Side Environment]
    LS[Low Side Environment]

    User -->|Logs onto a device in a| HS
    User -->|Logs onto a device in a| LS

    HS -->|Using a| HSD[Shared Device]
    HSD -->|Requires them to use| NoneHS[MFA: None]
    NoneHS --> NoProtection[None]

    LS -->|Using a| LSD[Shared Device]
    LS -->|Using a| MAC[Mac]
    LS -->|Using a| AVD[AVD]
    LS -->|Using a| SUL[Single Use Laptop]

    LSD -->|Requires them to use| NoneLS[MFA: None]
    MAC -->|Requires them to use| NoneMac[MFA: None]

    NoneLS --> NoProtection
    NoneMac --> NoProtection

    AVD -->|Requires them to use| SMS[MFA: SMS/Voice]
    SMS --> StandardMFA[Standard MFA]

    SUL -->|Requires them to use| WHFB[MFA: WHfB]
    WHFB --> PR[Phishing Resistant MFA]

    classDef env fill:#d9d2f3,stroke:#666;
    classDef mfa fill:#b6d7a8,stroke:#666;
    classDef outcome fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#666;

    class HS,LS,HSD,LSD,MAC,AVD,SUL env;
    class NoneHS,NoneLS,NoneMac,SMS,WHFB mfa;
    class NoProtection,StandardMFA,PR outcome;
```

# Standard Worker Device Sign In Auth (TOBE)

``` mermaid
flowchart LR

    User[Standard User]

    HS[High Side Environment]
    LS[Low Side Environment]

    User -->|Logs onto a device in a| HS
    User -->|Logs onto a device in a| LS

    HS -->|Using a| HSD[Shared Device]
    HSD -->|Requires them to use| FIDO2[MFA: FIDO2]
    FIDO2 --> PR[Phishing Resistant MFA]

    LS -->|Using a| LSD[Shared Device]
    LS -->|Using a| AVD[AVD]
    LS -->|Using a| SUL[Single Use Laptop]
    LS -->|Using a| MAC[Mac]

    LSD -->|Gives them a| Choice{Choice of<br/>Authentication Method}
    AVD -->|Gives them a| Choice

    Choice -->|Using| Passkey["MFA: MS Authenticator<br/>Passkey"]
    Choice -->|Using| Push["MFA: MS Authenticator<br/>Push"]
    Choice -->|Using| AuthFido[MFA: FIDO2]

    AuthFido --> PR
    Passkey --> PR

    Push --> SMFA[Standard MFA]

    SUL -->|Requires them to use| WHFB[MFA: WHfB]
    WHFB --> PR

    MAC -->|Requires them to use| PSSO[MFA: Platform SSO]
    PSSO --> PR

    classDef env fill:#d9d2f3,stroke:#666;
    classDef mfa fill:#b6d7a8,stroke:#666;
    classDef outcome fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#666;
    classDef decision fill:#00cc66,stroke:#666;

    class HS,LS,HSD,LSD,AVD,SUL,MAC env;
    class FIDO2,AuthFido,Passkey,Push,WHFB,PSSO mfa;
    class PR,SMFA outcome;
    class Choice decision;
```

# Privileged Standard Worker account Auth options (ASIS)

``` mermaid
flowchart LR

    User[Privileged Standard User]

    HS[High Side Environment]
    LS[Low Side Environment]

    User -->|My users are sometimes based in a| HS
    User -->|My users are based in a| LS

    %% High Side
    HS -->|Using a| HSShared[Shared Device]
    HS -->|Using a| HSLaptop[Single Use Laptop]

    HSShared -->|They need| HSSharedPR[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    HSShared -->|They need| HSSharedStd[Standard MFA]

    HSLaptop -->|They need| HSLaptopPR[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    HSLaptop -->|They need| HSLaptopStd[Standard MFA]

    HSSharedPR --> HSSharedNone["1. No MFA Options"]
    HSSharedStd --> HSSharedNone2["1. No MFA Options"]

    HSLaptopPR --> HSLaptopWhfb["1. WHfB"]
    HSLaptopStd --> HSLaptopNone["1. No MFA Options"]

    %% Low Side
    LS -->|Using a| Mac[Mac]
    LS -->|Using a| LSShared[Shared Device]
    LS -->|Using a| LSLaptop[Single Use Laptop]
    LS -->|Using a| AVD[AVD]

    %% Mac
    Mac -->|They need| MacPR[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    Mac -->|They need| MacStd[Standard MFA]

    MacPR --> MacNone["1. No MFA Options"]
    MacStd --> MacStdOpts["1. MS Authenticator Push<br/>2. SMS/Voice"]

    %% Shared Device
    LSShared -->|They need| SharedPR[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    LSShared -->|They need| SharedStd[Standard MFA]

    SharedPR --> SharedNone["1. No MFA Options"]
    SharedStd --> SharedStdOpts["1. MS Authenticator Push<br/>2. SMS/Voice"]

    %% Single Use Laptop
    LSLaptop -->|They need| LaptopPR[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    LSLaptop -->|They need| LaptopStd[Standard MFA]

    LaptopPR --> LaptopWhfb["1. WHfB"]
    LaptopStd --> LaptopStdOpts["1. MS Authenticator Push<br/>2. SMS/Voice"]

    %% AVD
    AVD -->|They need| AVDPR[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    AVD -->|They need| AVDStd[Standard MFA]

    AVDPR --> AVDNone["1. No MFA Options"]
    AVDStd --> AVDSMS["1. SMS/Voice"]

    classDef env fill:#d9d2f3,stroke:#666;
    classDef requirement fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#666;
    classDef option fill:#b6d7a8,stroke:#666;
    classDef nooption fill:#ff6666,stroke:#666,color:#000;

    class HS,LS,HSShared,HSLaptop,Mac,LSShared,LSLaptop,AVD env;
    class HSSharedPR,HSSharedStd,HSLaptopPR,HSLaptopStd,MacPR,MacStd,SharedPR,SharedStd,LaptopPR,LaptopStd,AVDPR,AVDStd requirement;
    class HSLaptopWhfb,MacStdOpts,SharedStdOpts,LaptopWhfb,LaptopStdOpts,AVDSMS option;
    class HSSharedNone,HSSharedNone2,HSLaptopNone,MacNone,SharedNone,AVDNone nooption;
```

# Privileged Standard Worker account Auth options (TOBE)

``` mermaid
flowchart LR

    User[Privileged Standard User]

    HS[High Side Environment]
    LS[Low Side Environment]

    User -->|My users are sometimes based in a| HS
    User -->|My users are based in a| LS

    %% High Side
    HS -->|Using a| HSShared[Shared Device]
    HS -->|Using a| HSLaptop[Single Use Laptop]

    HSShared -->|They need| HSSharedReq[Phishing Resistant MFA or lower]
    HSLaptop -->|They need| HSLaptopReq[Phishing Resistant MFA or lower]

    HSSharedReq -->|Their options are| HSFIDO2["1. FIDO2"]
    HSLaptopReq -->|Their options are| HSLaptopOpts["1. WHfB<br/>2. FIDO2"]

    %% Low Side
    LS -->|Using a| LSShared[Shared Device]
    LS -->|Using a| AVD[AVD]
    LS -->|Using a| LSLaptop[Single Use Laptop]
    LS -->|Using a| Mac[Mac]

    LSShared -->|They need| LSSharedReq[Phishing Resistant MFA or lower]
    AVD -->|They need| AVDReq[Phishing Resistant MFA or lower]
    LSLaptop -->|They need| LSLaptopReq[Phishing Resistant MFA or lower]
    Mac -->|They need| MacReq[Phishing Resistant MFA or lower]

    LSSharedReq --> SharedOpts["1. MS Authenticator Push<br/>2. MS Authenticator Passkey<br/>3. FIDO2"]

    AVDReq --> AVDOpts["1. WHfB<br/>2. MS Authenticator Push<br/>3. MS Authenticator Passkey<br/>4. FIDO2"]

    LSLaptopReq --> LaptopOpts["1. WHfB<br/>2. MS Authenticator Push<br/>3. MS Authenticator Passkey"]

    MacReq --> MacOpts["1. Platform SSO<br/>2. MS Authenticator Push<br/>3. MS Authenticator Passkey<br/>4. FIDO2"]

    classDef env fill:#d9d2f3,stroke:#666;
    classDef requirement fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#666;
    classDef options fill:#b6d7a8,stroke:#666;

    class HS,LS,HSShared,HSLaptop,LSShared,AVD,LSLaptop,Mac env;
    class HSSharedReq,HSLaptopReq,LSSharedReq,AVDReq,LSLaptopReq,MacReq requirement;
    class HSFIDO2,HSLaptopOpts,SharedOpts,AVDOpts,LaptopOpts,MacOpts options;
```

# Privileged Admin User flows

``` mermaid
flowchart LR

    User[Privileged Admin User]

    LS[Low Side Environment]

    User -->|Signs in from a| LS

    Decision{Scenario}

    LS --> Decision

    %% ASIS
    Decision -->|ASIS| AsisGroup["Device belongs to<br/>MoJO-M365-Admin-Devices<br/>Security Group"]

    AsisGroup -->|Authentication options| AsisPasskey[MS Authenticator Passkey]

    AsisPasskey -->|Provides| AsisResult[Phishing Resistant MFA]

    %% TOBE
    Decision -->|TOBE| TobeGroup["Device belongs to<br/>MoJO-M365-Admin-Devices<br/>Security Group"]

    TobeGroup -->|Authentication options| TobePasskey[MS Authenticator Passkey]
    TobeGroup -->|Authentication options| TobeFido2[FIDO2 Security Key]

    TobePasskey -->|Provides| TobeResult[Phishing Resistant MFA]
    TobeFido2 -->|Provides| TobeResult

    classDef env fill:#d9d2f3,stroke:#666;
    classDef scenario fill:#34c759,stroke:#333,color:#000;
    classDef auth fill:#a8ddb5,stroke:#666;
    classDef outcome fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#666;
    classDef decision fill:#00cc66,stroke:#333;

    class LS,AsisGroup,TobeGroup env;
    class AsisPasskey,TobePasskey,TobeFido2 auth;
    class AsisResult,TobeResult outcome;
    class Decision decision;
```

